----------
All brand names, logos, and trademarks distributed by this package are the
property of their respective owners. Their inclusion in this package does
not imply endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation with the trademark
holders, nor any transfer of trademark rights.

This package is an unofficial, community-maintained collection. Each
individual logo is reproduced from publicly available sources for
identification purposes. If you are a trademark holder and want a logo
removed, updated, or attributed differently, please open an issue at:

  https://github.com/hafidznoor/idn-finlogos/issues

SOURCES
-------
Logos in this collection were curated from publicly available materials,
including Seeklogo.com, Logos.fandom.com, Masvian.com, Vector69.com, and
official corporate materials.

